Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Twenty-Third Episode\NThe Phantom Knight
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.18,0:01:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, before I tell you\Ntoday's story,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.82,0:02:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I will summarize the last episode.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.50,0:02:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,One night,\Nthe King was no longer to be found..
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.02,0:02:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,...and people thought\Nthat he was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.70,0:02:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Sapphire prepared\Nto become King.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.30,0:02:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But during the ceremony\Nof coronation,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.38,0:02:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,the Queen was deceived\Nby Grand Duke Duralumin and Nylon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.30,0:02:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,and drank some drugged wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.06,0:02:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the situation became serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.42,0:02:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This drug had the effect\Nof making whoever drinks it say...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.10,0:02:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,everything they think.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.14,0:02:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen revealed the secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.42,0:02:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,In front of various representatives\Ngathered from all over the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.62,0:02:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,she confessed that Sapphire\Nwas a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.42,0:02:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, Sapphire and the Queen\Nwere condemned...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.42,0:02:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,...to be locked up in the\Ncoffin tower as punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.54,0:02:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Today's story tells you\Nabout what happened...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.82,0:02:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,...to the two of them while they were\Nlocked in prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.50,0:03:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Gama! Where is the jailer Gama?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.10,0:03:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here! I'm coming right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.78,0:04:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mother!\N- Try to stay calm
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.94,0:04:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring out Sapphire and the Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.30,0:04:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.62,0:04:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.62,0:04:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome,\NPrincess Sapphire and the Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.98,0:04:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Gama,\NI'll leave everything to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.22,0:04:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let's go!\N- Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.94,0:04:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, alright, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.66,0:04:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.90,0:04:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My God, how gloomy this tower is!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.74,0:04:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, enter!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.18,0:04:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this whistling sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.70,0:05:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the wind. If you are afraid\Nof this simple noise,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.74,0:05:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- you won't be able to live here.\N- Where is our room?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.82,0:05:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Go up the stairs and you will find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.42,0:05:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- They are bats.\N- How creepy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.18,0:05:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's full of beasts here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.02,0:05:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We have arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.70,0:05:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.26,0:05:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't there a bed in this room?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.54,0:05:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Bed?\NHey, bring those two beds!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.70,0:05:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.22,0:05:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.46,0:05:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,They are my entourage!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.50,0:05:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me that jewel\Nin exchange for the two beds
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.14,0:05:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! This is\Na dear keepsake of the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.26,0:05:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, then take back\Nthe beds!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.94,0:06:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.26,0:06:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And then you will sleep\Non the cold floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.94,0:06:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- Listen, Gama...\N- Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.82,0:06:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mother!\N- Oh, alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.90,0:06:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey, bring back the beds!\N- Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.66,0:06:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, turn on the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.22,0:06:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey, bring the lamps!\N- Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.78,0:06:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me that brooch in\Nexchange for the lamps!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.22,0:06:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This is too much!\NNow stop it! Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.94,0:06:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- He says he doesn't need them anymore!\N- Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.58,0:06:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! We can't do without them.\NHere!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.74,0:06:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been here for three days now.\NSapphire, you're hungry, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.46,0:06:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But you only had\Na small breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.38,0:07:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to prepare dinner for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.26,0:07:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish you would,\Nbut I have nothing left.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.82,0:07:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You took all my jewels!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.54,0:07:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean "nothing"?\NYou still have those gorgeous clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.30,0:07:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If I give you these clothes,\Nwill you give me others?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.22,0:07:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I will give you others!\NAnd very beautiful ones, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.14,0:07:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mother...!\N- Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.70,0:07:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, what clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.18,0:07:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter, we don't need\Nbeautiful clothes here anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.62,0:07:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Dinner is ready! Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.82,0:07:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Good heavens! And in exchange\Nyou give us so little to eat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.22,0:07:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine, but I want\NSapphire to eat more!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.74,0:07:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you will need\Nmany more jewels!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.82,0:07:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But now I have nothing left!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.10,0:07:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you, perhaps,\Nhiding some?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.62,0:07:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Really,\NI have nothing left.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.14,0:07:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing! You have nothing, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.54,0:07:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you will do the washing\Nand the Princess will sweep!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.30,0:07:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! You are ordering\Nmy mother to wash...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.74,0:08:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- Silence!\N- Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.22,0:08:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You will have to work a lot\Nand hard too, if you want to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.58,0:08:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- You're cheerful, Sapphire.\N- Yes! Better to sing than to cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.10,0:08:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And besides, I must say\Nthat singing helps me work!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.14,0:08:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right! It helps\Nme too, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.14,0:08:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.82,0:08:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't waste time chattering!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.90,0:08:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And now let's see where\NI can throw this garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.46,0:08:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, there! I found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.98,0:08:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll throw them out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.70,0:09:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My God, this is Gama's room!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.02,0:09:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! If you play another\Ntrick like that on me, I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.30,0:09:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, but I didn't\Nknow it was your room!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.06,0:09:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead of going to dinner, you\Nwill clean the floor! Understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.38,0:09:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's see...\NWhere is the cleaning rag?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.90,0:09:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, here it is! I found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.90,0:10:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If you sing, you can't\Nclean well! Give it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.26,0:10:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Look how it's done!\NHow dirty this rag is!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.54,0:10:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But these are my\Nclothes! Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.62,0:10:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Your clothes?! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.74,0:10:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here, so I can strangle you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.14,0:11:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that! Oh, no!\NAll my lunch! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.14,0:11:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to go hungry\Nand I also have a headache!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.06,0:11:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You, meanwhile, will go to work\Nwithout eating! Go on, get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.98,0:11:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, soon, we will see the sun...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.14,0:11:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Stop singing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.74,0:11:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about grinding\Nand making good bread!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.50,0:11:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I will eat it, you damned idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.82,0:11:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's a mouse!\NWait, thief mouse!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.90,0:12:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,My God...!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.90,0:12:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.06,0:12:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me carefully! You will kill\Nall the mice in this tower!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.58,0:12:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No! They are God's creatures!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.78,0:12:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm very hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.66,0:12:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow you can eat\Nmy lunch too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.18,0:12:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm so happy!\N- Good heavens! Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.02,0:12:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Because even if we suffer,\Nwe can be together so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.54,0:12:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If only dad\Ncould be here with us...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.94,0:12:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You promised not to cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.90,0:12:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm sorry.\N- It's not so bad here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.74,0:13:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no one\Nplotting against us,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.82,0:13:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,there is no Duralumin\Nand not even Nylon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.14,0:13:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Sapphire! When I look at you,\NI feel great courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.58,0:13:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes...\NBut I'm so hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.18,0:13:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you come to thank me?\NDon't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.22,0:13:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, mother!\NThey brought us food!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.94,0:13:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Splendid! Another one!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.78,0:13:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a notice! "From now on,\Nno one shall speak of Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.94,0:13:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever utters his name will\Nbe whipped a hundred times...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.62,0:13:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,...and will be sentenced to\Nslavery. Grand Duke Duralumin".
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.18,0:13:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That cursed Duralumin\Nis ruling like a tyrant!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.46,0:13:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.94,0:14:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I am sure that this\Nnotice is not the only one!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.94,0:14:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that my father and I\Nare not here, he's hard at work!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.30,0:14:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How I wish I could get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.42,0:14:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What are they doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.18,0:14:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.30,0:14:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this hole?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.70,0:14:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,How deep it is!\NI think it leads to the dungeons.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.22,0:14:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, it's very narrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.50,0:15:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.06,0:15:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,How wonderful! Thank you!\NThank you, little mice!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.70,0:15:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sapphire! - Mother, there's an exit\Nthis way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.14,0:15:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- Come!\N- Now let's get out of this place!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.90,0:15:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This hole is too small\Nfor me. Escape by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.98,0:15:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No! I will never be separated from you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.90,0:15:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you must escape, Sapphire,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.58,0:15:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,and fight\Nagainst our enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.70,0:15:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Gama is coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.50,0:15:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,May I know\Nwhat you are whispering?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.78,0:15:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing! I was only saying\Nthat I'm hungry! So hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.34,0:16:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me stories!\NI'm not buying it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.14,0:16:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You were planning to escape, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.50,0:16:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember that, if you escape,\NI will cut off the Queen's head!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.98,0:16:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- My God! - What?!\N- Duralumin ordered me to!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.98,0:16:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mother!\N- Don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.14,0:16:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here right now\Nand go fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.54,0:16:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your duty\Nas Prince of Silverland.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.42,0:16:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But if they should catch me, you..
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.58,0:16:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, what is more important?\NMy life...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.58,0:16:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,...or the life of so many poor\Npeople who, at this moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.50,0:16:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,are suffering\Nunder cruel laws?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.78,0:16:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mother, look!\N- Look at those little mice!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.34,0:16:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My sword and my clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.50,0:16:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You took them from Gama's room,\Nright?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.42,0:17:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, whip him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.22,0:17:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me well, everyone!\NThis man spoke of Sapphire
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.74,0:17:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,...and called King Plastic\Nan "idiot",
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.94,0:17:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,therefore he was whipped
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.06,0:17:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,...and now he will work as a\Nslave for the rest of his life!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.46,0:17:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He will be a slave for his whole life!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.42,0:17:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor boy..!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.90,0:17:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.94,0:17:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This cursed child\Nwas praising Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.54,0:17:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?!\N- Sapphire was very kind!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.22,0:17:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Plastic is an idiot and an imbecile!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.78,0:17:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Wretched child!\NWhip him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.82,0:18:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He will not be spared just\Nbecause he is a child! Go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.02,0:18:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my son! He is my only\Nson! Please, forgive him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.74,0:18:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No! Go away, or\Nyou will be whipped too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.22,0:18:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- Come on, hurry up! Go!\N- Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.22,0:18:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! And who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.90,0:18:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the phantom knight!\NRemember me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.54,0:18:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! The phantom knight?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.62,0:18:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a suspicious man! Arrest him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.30,0:19:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?\NHave you given up already?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.82,0:19:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you challenge me, brat?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.54,0:19:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You dared to challenge\Nme I'll make you pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.18,0:19:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray! Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.50,0:19:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy, cut the rope of the\Nprisoners with this sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.54,0:19:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, phantom knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.50,0:19:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Knight, please, will\Nyou show me your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.54,0:19:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I cannot do it! Farewell!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.70,0:20:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I never..! Well, I never!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.42,0:20:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You look like an idiot!\NAre you hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.30,0:20:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a complete idiot!\NGet out of the way, Plastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.62,0:20:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening, Nylon?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.22,0:20:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, please listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.26,0:20:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Suddenly\Na strange guy appeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.58,0:20:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He freed all the prisoners\Nand let them escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.06,0:20:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,A strange guy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.98,0:20:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! He was very strange!\NHe was three meters tall!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.82,0:20:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We could have beaten\Nhim, if he hadn't been so tall!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.42,0:20:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- Extremely tall!\N- Don't talk nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.46,0:20:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, there he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.34,0:20:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he the strange guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.94,0:20:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Soldiers! Soldiers!\NThat guy is a scoundrel!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.66,0:20:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He's near the window!\NAttack him from all sides!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.94,0:20:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Appost yourselves outside the window!\NDon't let him escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.90,0:20:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just you and me, Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.42,0:21:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare he break\Nmy beautiful bookcase?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.54,0:21:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- Catch him immediately!\N- Catch him immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.14,0:21:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.70,0:21:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, arrogant Duralumin: if\Nyou make people suffer again,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.02,0:21:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,the phantom knight will kill you!\NRemember it well!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.50,0:21:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.26,0:21:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Nylon?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.34,0:21:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think his voice\Nsounds a lot like Sapphire's?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.38,0:21:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Sapphire?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.30,0:21:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!\NLet's split into two teams!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.38,0:21:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,One will hunt the knight and\Nthe other goes to the coffin tower...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.02,0:21:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,...to see if Sapphire\Nis there or not!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.58,0:21:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Go! The phantom knight...\Ncould be Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.34,0:22:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon has become alarmed and is going\Nto inspect the coffin tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.66,0:22:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I must hurry back,\Nor my mother will be in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.58,0:22:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Gama! Where is Gama? It's Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.14,0:22:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- Open the door immediately!\N- Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.90,0:22:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.38,0:23:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Nylon! Your nose\Nis getting bigger and bigger! How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.42,0:23:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!\NI was sure it was Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.70,0:23:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry if I'm a bit late
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.42,0:23:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm more relieved
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.14,0:23:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If you were any later,\NI would have really worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.90,0:23:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, how sweaty you are..
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.30,0:23:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Good! So Sapphire\Nwas in the Coffin Tower!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.02,0:23:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! As long as you leave them alive,\Nwe'll have problems!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.06,0:23:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.90,0:23:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already thought of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.26,0:23:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I sent five assassins\Nto the tower,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.90,0:23:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,with the order to kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.26,0:23:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,By now\Nthey must have already arrived
